SUMMARY:Harbour panigiri of 16 August\, Marmari
LOCATION:Marmari\, Evia (South)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The ferry port of Marmari\, an hour from Rafina\, follows the Dekapentavgoustos with its own harbour panigiri on the night of 16 August\, with a nisiotika orchestra and singers (Matthaios Giannoulis and Maria Nomikou in 2025) and dancing on the quay. Easy to reach from Athens for a night\; the last boat back is around midnight in summer\, so plan to stay.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-south/#marmari-harbour-panigiri-of-16-august-marmari
